# Step 7C release-readiness fix: without this, `COPY . .` in
# docker/backend/Dockerfile bakes in whatever happens to exist on the
# HOST at build time -- confirmed this was actually happening: a built
# image contained real locally-generated scan reports (reports/) and a
# .pytest_cache from local test runs. Neither belongs in an image that
# might get pushed to a registry.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
reports/
.env
.env.*
.git/
